x: foo
y: bar" however, unlike java c# does give the developer the opportunity to pass parameters by reference , this is done by using the 'ref' keyword before the type of the parameter: private void swap(ref string a, ref string b) {
  string tmp = a;
  a = b;
  b = tmp;
} this swap will change the value of the referenced parameter: string x = "foo";
